  "lines": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "You order a Domino's, then sit there staring at your phone.",
      "start": 0.16,
      "end": 3.88,
      "matched": "11/11"
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": "Being made.",
      "start": 4.16,
      "end": 5.08,
      "matched": "2/2"
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "In the oven.",
      "start": 5.28,
      "end": 6.08,
      "matched": "3/3"
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "Now Mike's bringing it to you.",
      "start": 6.32,
      "end": 8.12,
      "matched": "6/6"
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "You'd think that tracker is there so you know when to open the door.",
      "start": 8.4,
      "end": 11.849,
      "matched": "14/14"
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "That's the small part.",
      "start": 11.92,
      "end": 13.32,
      "matched": "4/4"
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "The pizza doesn't get to you a second faster.",
      "start": 13.36,
      "end": 15.88,
      "matched": "9/9"
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "But the wait stops feeling like a wait.",
      "start": 15.92,
      "end": 18.173,
      "matched": "8/8"
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "Because a silent wait feels like nobody's working on it.",
      "start": 18.24,
      "end": 21.56,
      "matched": "10/10"
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "A wait you can watch feels like somebody is.",
      "start": 21.6,
      "end": 24.333,
      "matched": "9/9"
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "And when you can see the work, you'll wait longer and like them more for it.",
      "start": 24.4,
      "end": 28.571,
      "matched": "16/16"
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "The tracker didn't make the pizza better.",
      "start": 28.64,
      "end": 30.84,
      "matched": "7/7"
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "It just stopped hiding the kitchen.",
      "start": 30.88,
      "end": 32.84,
      "matched": "6/6"
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "So if you sell anything, show them the work.",
      "start": 32.947,
      "end": 35.8,
      "matched": "9/9"
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "text": "Don't go quiet for a week and drop the finished thing.",
      "start": 35.84,
      "end": 38.733,
      "matched": "11/11"
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "text": "Send a photo of it in the oven.",
      "start": 38.8,
      "end": 40.571,
      "matched": "8/8"
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "text": "Send this to the friend whose clients always text, any update?",
      "start": 40.64,
      "end": 44.0,
      "matched": "11/11"
    }
  ],
